team/apps/3962760/extras/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1755950120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1755950120 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Three Games, One Universe</strong><br>Enjoy 4-player variants of Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon \u2014 each uniquely adapted for modern, multiplayer play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Elemental Identity</strong><br>Select your element at the start of each match. Each element is visually represented through your pieces and throne.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Multiplayer &amp; AI</strong><br>Play online with friends or go solo against smart AI-controlled opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized 3D Graphics</strong><br>Experience visually rich game boards, dynamic VFX, and immersive ambient design inspired by cosmic mythologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Lore-Driven Intro Cinematic</strong><br>Dive into the mythic backstory of Quess through a beautifully crafted opening sequence that sets the stakes of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.poster.avif?t=1755950120\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.webm?t=1755950120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.mp4?t=1755950120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragra